ntity, source path, page count, SHA-256, source-review posture, render-sanity status, and blockers. The readback records `render_governance_reports_missing_from_task_worktree` because the two optional 2026-07-01 method-map reports are absent in this worktree.\n\n## Notes\n\nThe validator status is `pass_with_warnings` because the registry intentionally preserves the existing duplicate document identity for `9709_w21_ms_12.pdf` and `9709_w21_ms_12(1).pdf` as two path-addressable rows with `duplicate_document_identity_requires_human_source_selection` blockers. No canonical source selection is made in this PR.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` as the required first command: exited 0; branch-safety warning only, clean worktree at start.\n- `uv run --with pymupdf --with pillow python ...` generator: created the three requested artifacts; rendered 1,784 sampled pages across 892 PDFs; all sampled pages nonblank.\n- `uv run --with pymupdf --with pillow python ...` independent verifier: parsed both JSON artifacts, checked 892 unique `source_document_id` values, verified required fields/path/checksum/page identity for all rows, and re-rendered/rehashed all 1,784 sampled pages.\n- `git diff --check`: exited 0.\n- `git diff --cached --check`: exited 0.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` after staging: exited 0; guard checks healthy, with expected warnings for staged changes and AO branch naming.\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T03:55:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T05:26:33Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T05:26:33Z","merged_at":"2026-07-01T05:26:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"a1aad56646235e80088517cd72f7b4224a91ac78","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1105/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1105/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/